ept is sound and efficient. I'd lean toward approval with a moderate-to-high promise score.\n\nI'll approve this. Promise: around 72-78. It's solid, well-aligned with our constraints, but the \"real-time\" and \"anomaly detection\" language introduces some scope risk that keeps it from being a 90+.\n",
