m middleware and a distributed ledger when off-the-shelf or lightly-customized solutions (experiment trackers + hash-chained logs on existing storage) would suffice.\n\nPromise score: I'd say around 40-50. The problem is real, the direction is right, but the specific solution is over-engineered from an efficiency standpoint.\n",
